<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20610" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βουληφόρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>counselling, advising</i>,
			in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
			</span></i> a constant epith. of princes and leaders, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. ἄνδρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					2.24
				</span></i>
			, al.; title of Artemis, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				2660.3
			</span></i> (Milet.): also c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. Ἀχαιῶν,
				Τρώων</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				24.651
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.180
			</span></i>; in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.112
			</span></i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔτ᾽ ἀγοραὶ β. οὔτε θέμιστες</span>,
			cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				12.5
			</span></i>: in later Prose, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βουλευτής, οἱ τοῦ μιάσματος
					β.</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
				3.5
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ρως</span>
			<i>like a counsellor</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				123
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
